 or control\, French peacekeeping forces move out\, warning the remaining w
 hite residents that they’re on their own. But Maria refuses to be driven
  off the land\, even as tragedy looms.\n\nTickets: https://tickets.thecine
 magictheater.com/checkout/showing/white-material/4047153/\n\nMore showtime
 s: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
