GEO:45.5122;-122.6366
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Hayao Miyazaki · 134 min\n\nAshitaka\, a prince of the di
 sappearing Emishi people\, is cursed by a demonized boar god and must jour
 ney to the west to find a cure. Along the way\, he encounters San\, a youn
 g human woman fighting to protect the forest\, and Lady Eboshi\, who is tr
 ying to destroy it. Ashitaka must find a way to bring balance to this conf
 lict.\n\nTickets: https://tickets.thecinemagictheater.com/checkout/showing
 /princess-mononoke/4133468/\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.
